<title>USA: KLS Enviro ships 4 drilling rigs.</title>
<headline>KLS Enviro ships 4 drilling rigs.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Tex. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLS Enviro Resources Inc said Monday it recently shipped four new drilling rigs to an unnamed gold mining company.</p>
<p>The rigs, which will be used in both Alaska and at other North American sites, will add over $2.4 million in annual gross revenue to KLS and bring the total number of KLS rigs currently operating to 13, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
